# ============================================================
# FinSight AI — runtime dependency intent
#
# This file records WHICH packages the application needs and the minimum
# versions it relies on. requirements.txt holds the exact versions that are
# installed and tested.
#
# To review or raise a floor, edit this file. To change what is installed,
# edit requirements.txt. Dependabot proposes updates against requirements.txt.
#
# Direct dependencies are pinned; transitive dependencies are not. See the
# note at the top of requirements.txt for why.
# ============================================================

